WEBVTT

00:09:06.272 --> 00:09:39.280
★Ethan dropped his phone last week, and the screen broke. He thought about buying a new phone, but his mother advised him that he should get his phone fixed at a store. Ethan went to a shop in the mall, and they fixed his phone for a lot less money than a new one would have cost. Now, he is more careful when he uses his phone.
☆☆Question: Why did Ethan get his phone screen fixed at a store?
